 supplies what is needed to address composite indexes."}, {"id": "1cfa1f87-4c7d-4777-8563-f9e7b3627bdb", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Composite indexes", "children": [], "description": "Composite indexes is an executable part of indexes; its correctness, cost, and failure modes recur in later problems and implementations. As the final topic in this module, composite indexes carries the completed idea into query processing."}]}, {"id": "945c8530-6d10-4cef-bc74-0e10c2e8be40", "type": "topic", "title": "Query processing", "description": "This module builds directly on indexes and develops query processing. It belongs here because its methods and distinctions are prerequisites for query optimization.", "children": [{"id": "c79421a2-e8a3-4a41-a032-6752839e9f73", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Scans", "children": [], "description": "Scans identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within query processing. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. It appears before external sort because that next topic assumes this starting point."}, {"id": "69342940-0c61-41c3-8739-ad15d4b230e3", "type": "subtopic", "title": "External sort", "children": [], "description": "External sort identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within query processing. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After scans, external sort supplies what is needed to address join algorithms."}, {"id": "f2bc4adc-209f-40f2-8d1e-a4ded4941f3a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Join algorithms", "children": [], "description": "Join algorithms is an executable part of query processing; its correctness, cost, and failure modes recur in later problems and implementations. After external sort, join algorithms supplies what is needed to address pipelining."}, {"id": "bafb2360-6d5c-410c-9f2d-e3b3f8727936", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Pipelining", "children": [], "description": "Pipelining identi